      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that its not ideal but i really just need to know if it's like, life-threatening or something. i dont want to do anything crazy, just like a small dose of valium, like 2mg or 5mg, to take with my seroquel so i can finally rest. if i only take a little bit it shouldn't be a big problem right? its not like i'm taking a bunch of them at once. can you just tell me if a small dose is safe?",
